      "color": "6",
      "text": "# Source of Truth\n`docs/prototypes/Fox_Line_v30.html`\n- 10 exact color tokens\n- Bricolage + Figtree + JetBrains Mono\n- 191-pt ridge cut (`ridge.json`)\n- Zero glow, zero orb, zero HUD"
