    },
    {
      "id": "p0_p1_p2",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -620,
      "y": 0,
      "width": 360,
      "height": 230,
      "color": "4",
      "text": "## Phases 0, 1 & 2 (Done)\n- **Phase 0:** OpenJDK 17, SDK 35, Gradle 8.11.1, POCO C71 ADB\n- **Phase 1 (`c76a464`):** Deleted C/JNI/NDK; pure Kotlin `FoxSpring.kt`\n- **Phase 2 (`be8a09a`):** Bundled fonts + `FoxTheme.kt` (`FoxColors`, `FoxInkBox`)"
    },
    {
      "id": "p3_p4",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -180,
      "y": 0,
      "width": 420,
      "height": 230,
      "color": "4",
      "text": "## Phases 3 & 4 (Done)\n- **Phase 3 (`1b60c30`):** `DepthWallpaperAndClock.kt` (191-pt ridge cut, 118sp clock tucked behind ridge, 3-layer tilt parallax)\n- **Phase 4 (`d4890d8`):** `WorkHomeScreen.kt` + `WordsRepository.kt` (`.work` block at 54% H, `Continue` pill, `Set 7:00` alarm chip, `#words` fitted under ridge)"
    },
    {
      "id": "p45",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 320,
      "y": -260,
      "width": 420,
      "height": 220,
      "color": "4",
      "text": "## Phase 4.5: Speed Gate (Done)\n**Commit `f2cf075`**\n- `requestHighRefreshRate()` (Mode 2 `120Hz` vote)\n- R8-minified `benchmark` build + `profileinstaller`\n- Pre-baked screen-sized sky & ridge bitmaps (-78% VRAM)\n- Offscreen GPU layers + 0 fps idle tilt sleep\n- **POCO C71 `gfxinfo`: `p50=11ms, p90=15ms, p99=16ms, gpu=6ms, janky=0.00%`**"
    },
    {
      "id": "p5",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 320,
      "y": 0,
      "width": 420,
      "height": 250,
      "color": "4",
      "text": "## Phase 5: The Fox Line (Done — PAUSED HERE)\n**Commit `2af3bcb`**\n- `FoxLineState.kt` urgency queue (`xfer -> timer! -> msg -> cont -> order -> timer -> music`)\n- `FoxLineCanvas.kt` (8 bar shapes, secondary bead, hold-to-wake Fox chips, water ripple rings)\n- `IslandCard.kt` (`LiveActivityIslandCard`, GPU `graphicsLayer`)\n- `FoxLineDebugMenu.kt` (long-press clock hook)\n- System bottom nav bar hidden (`gpu_p50=6ms, gpu_p90=8ms`)"
    },
    {
      "id": "p6_next",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 820,
      "y": 0,
      "width": 380,
      "height": 250,
      "color": "2",
      "text": "## Next Up (After Pause)\n- **Phase 6:** The Search Drawer (Spotlight 56% H, 1:1 drag + springs, real `PackageManager` apps)\n- **Phase 7:** Send & Receive (1 liquid morphing composable, 6 spring channels)\n- **Phase 8:** The Dashboard (pull-down parting painting at ridge)\n- **Phases 9–13:** Polish, Perf, AGSL Ripple, Screenrecord, Real Mac `FoxLinkClient`"
    },
